   "line": [
    "e6"
   ],
   "spoken": "Black could take on d4, but e6 develops the bishop. When in doubt, keep the tension — let White decide whether to take; that is always less of a headache than asking yourself the same question."
  },
  {
   "ply": 17,
   "t": 221,
   "fen": "r3kb1r/p4ppp/2p1pn2/q1pp4/3P1Bb1/2N1PN1P/PPP2PP1/R2Q1RK1 b kq - 0 9",
