   "line": [
    "Bh5"
   ],
   "spoken": "Take on f3, or retreat? Ask: will White realistically play g4? No — it is tremendously weakening, right in front of his own king. So keep the tension."
  },
  {
   "ply": 19,
   "t": 255,
   "fen": "r3kb1r/p4ppp/2p1pn2/q1pp3b/3P1BP1/2N1PN1P/PPP2P2/R2Q1RK1 b kq - 0 10",
