   "fen": "r3kb1r/p4ppp/2p1pnb1/q1ppN3/3P1BP1/2N1P2P/PPP2P2/R2Q1RK1 b kq - 2 11",
   "line": [
    "Ne5"
   ],
   "spoken": "The knight to e5 looks intimidating but it is surface-level — it hits c6. Just defend the pawn carefully: the queen to b6 walks into the knight to a4."
